OL,3,GNEWSABacklash after councillor tells
OL,4,ARussell Brand to 'stay strong'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConvicted rapist Russell Brand would
OL,7,Fhave been "viewed differently" if he
OL,8,Fwas "Muslim or an illegal migrant
OL,9,Finvader", a Restore Britain councillor
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FOwain Clatworthy said "the same people
OL,13,Fscreaming for his head right now would
OL,14,Fbe calling the charges 'Islamophobic',
OL,15,Fdemanding the case be dropped, and
OL,16,Faccusing anyone who noticed of racism".
OL,18,FHe made the comments on social media,
OL,19,Fand claimed he had received death
OL,20,Fthreats as a result, which South Wales
OL,21,FPolice was investigating.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
